  "details": "With the VRC Constraints having an easy \"freeze to world\" function, it would be nice to have a simple way to late-sync the position/rotation/scale of a component.\n\nIt should be fairly simple to have something save out it's transform in world-space and sets it's transforms to that on avatar load.\n\nThus, I propose either a VRCLate Sync component to separate this functionality entirely, or an update to the VRCConstraints that lets their positions be sync'd when \"freeze to world\" is enabled.",
